      "username": "maxego",
      "name": "Max",
      "created_at": "2025-08-25T21:24:09.200Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello!</p>\n<p>I’m seeking help with implementing my customization case.<br>\nWe’re an accounting company, so for each of our Customer we may manage several Companies in Accounting.</p>\n<p>Therefore, we need a link to see which Customer is related to Which Company.<br>\nWe’ll need this link to:<br>\n-Manage Customer billing<br>\n-For access management so Customer would have access only to Companies linked to him.</p>\n<p>We’ve managed this how it is described in Documentation</p><aside class=\"quote\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"116552\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/void_moon/48/63268_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/how-to-install-many-to-many-relationship/116552/4\">How to install many-to-many relationship</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/framework/5\"><span data-category-id=\"5\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #F7941D; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF;\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category \" title=\"This is a subforum for all discussions related to Frappe Framework.\"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">Frappe Framework</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Yes, you need to create another doctype (Child Table) and mapping it to the original doctype (Field type as “Table” and options as Child Table docname). \nThis way you can map many rows to a document achieving one-many or many-many relationships.\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p>However the result is the following:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>On customer level I have to enter the customer in the table. Parent value is not inherited as it supposed to be (As I understood)<br>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/4/54dc6ec496350c2d5b39e6cb4a850592d30aafbf.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/54dc6ec496350c2d5b39e6cb4a850592d30aafbf\" title=\"Screenshot_28\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/4/54dc6ec496350c2d5b39e6cb4a850592d30aafbf_2_689x234.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_28\" data-base62-sha1=\"c6InHPVsV5XhTVP6ewikNuEk2dN\" width=\"689\" height=\"234\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/4/54dc6ec496350c2d5b39e6cb4a850592d30aafbf_2_689x234.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/4/54dc6ec496350c2d5b39e6cb4a850592d30aafbf_2_1033x351.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/4/54dc6ec496350c2d5b39e6cb4a850592d30aafbf.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1D1D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_28</span><span class=\"informations\">1231×418 29 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><p></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On Company side, on the other hand, the changes in the table are not reflected.<br>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/6/3676cf936637ac09cdae957071b475eadd1d1515.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3676cf936637ac09cdae957071b475eadd1d1515\" title=\"Screenshot_29\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/6/3676cf936637ac09cdae957071b475eadd1d1515_2_690x249.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_29\" data-base62-sha1=\"7LOkJFsmE1KYpDdrdcDVF7YKDKB\" width=\"690\" height=\"249\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/6/3676cf936637ac09cdae957071b475eadd1d1515_2_690x249.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/6/3676cf936637ac09cdae957071b475eadd1d1515_2_1035x373.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/6/3676cf936637ac09cdae957071b475eadd1d1515.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1B1B1C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_29</span><span class=\"informations\">1303×472 31.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><p></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Does anyone know what may be the problem and if this is a bug or a feature?</p>\n<p>Thank you!</p>",
